            <div xml:id="m-8192d468-6d25-4e99-87cf-00216759fa2a">
              <lg xml:id="m-911a7efd-9e26-40e6-8ed9-00d73fbc95e5">
                <l xml:id="m-7a19668e-306e-4b3e-9cfd-4fff62570725" facs="#m-326aeea7-1357-4f62-89d4-1d4c268eb7c6" label="text-like">sunday at Prime.</l><l xml:id="m-f9d5a3bb-6399-4867-a38b-18e339c8ea98" facs="#m-a5274dc0-1bbf-4079-90bf-c8424d1109f4" label="ambiguous">231</l><l xml:id="m-598b9df2-635f-44cf-b020-ebccf39302ff" facs="#m-3cfe291c-8127-443c-9fa7-7db45e8fa1d4" label="text-like">From the Ascension to the Vigil of Pentecost:</l><l xml:id="m-98930016-13fa-472d-87bf-925855bd3370" facs="#m-1f4262a6-48d6-467c-8ef2-c91e99747126" label="lyrics-like">V. Qui scándis super sídera.</l><l xml:id="m-c250aabd-653d-4f65-8d1d-e8f6bd5d3876" facs="#m-ffe22981-023c-4982-aef5-42bf1491686a" label="text-like">On the Feast of Pentecost and during its Octave:</l><l xml:id="m-da39ec54-c22b-49eb-ac8d-a0e740698153" facs="#m-e7d12725-c0c1-4556-9709-45764ebb99ea" label="lyrics-like">V. Qui sédes ad déxteram Pátris.</l><l xml:id="m-d817667a-0820-4c10-b07d-daeb8539447f" facs="#m-a5c8e179-e27f-4739-9132-9bd0e111961e" label="text-like">On the Feasts of the Blessed Virgin in Paschal Time:</l><l xml:id="m-3544d576-3778-42d5-936e-7e49db8dd0fe" facs="#m-b1d636af-c773-47f0-aeba-3fadf8db9635" label="lyrics-like">V. Qui ná-tus es de Ma-rí-a Virgine.</l><l xml:id="m-fc6cf146-cc8f-4a56-9c00-12b3d19fad21" facs="#m-24d4a6e7-f399-443a-a067-81b7768e598a" label="text-like">When the Office of the Sunday is said as in the Psalter, the followins</l><l xml:id="m-90b65f30-9469-4c4b-a2b0-b582d7c0314f" facs="#m-dab93d18-949d-4dc3-81bb-afc78b7f71e7" label="text-like">Prayers are added; they are not said. however, if the Commemoration of a</l><l xml:id="m-219dc54a-3493-431f-80af-ef6d71711995" facs="#m-a1d56990-a91b-45d6-94c0-7ba1a2b9a1a3" label="text-like">Feast or of an Octave occurs on Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-0225bedb-358a-4c80-9e6d-d25e0615c57c" facs="#m-ae7807d6-d5d2-4edc-97d7-949e3df29c52" label="ambiguous">Prayers (called Preces.)</l><l xml:id="m-6f9b949c-f711-4f80-8d72-dd66e1b4c9b6" facs="#m-607539a5-1fcb-474f-a284-162fc463955c" label="lyrics-like">LYri-e e-lé-i-son. Chríste e-lé-i-son. Ky-ri-e</l><l xml:id="m-30e675b0-035c-4a04-8f31-15fcc3736dfd" facs="#m-6c3069cd-1e7b-4cde-983f-a188cdfa00d2" label="lyrics-like">e-lé-i-son. Pá-ter nóster, continued in silence up to:</l><l xml:id="m-2c77a39c-f894-4911-8412-f2c444516878" facs="#m-11007b24-7c95-4ea3-8537-060cb94b72c5" label="lyrics-like">V. Et ne nos indúcas in tenta-ti-ónem.</l><l xml:id="m-8016b61c-2b48-4365-824d-074be0eedfdf" facs="#m-287603fe-a20d-49ba-91d9-e61fc9d32b03" label="lyrics-like">R. Sed libera nos a málo.</l><l xml:id="m-24b6dd6b-5343-422e-a01f-0f443420c621" facs="#m-86011460-bdee-4111-9795-fd70869e5073" label="lyrics-like">Crédo in Déum. continued in sitence up to:</l><l xml:id="m-3af120a6-b61f-40b1-bcb8-06e4232144ab" facs="#m-125a2819-407e-44f2-bee1-7b872b57af66" label="lyrics-like">V. Cárnis resurrectiónem.</l><l xml:id="m-428e4710-0ef8-4ab8-bbc0-a3077ba614da" facs="#m-8cd87ced-431c-443d-a522-d4a652af8688" label="lyrics-like">R. Vitam aetérnam. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-e9086c27-38ed-4e01-82da-f1d8e9621ced" facs="#m-ebe60424-0e52-4ca5-8de5-c998453ec574" label="lyrics-like">V. Et égo ad te Dómine clamávi.</l><l xml:id="m-fc355fad-c8ad-482d-8f3e-116fbfc41971" facs="#m-d86c16f9-3677-48d1-9cd3-54d47d99332f" label="lyrics-like">H. Et máne orátio méa praevéniet te.</l><l xml:id="m-7bef11b4-8543-4979-ad41-1da02271c0e8" facs="#m-16ed5be9-57f1-49bd-a2bd-6554879954a8" label="lyrics-like">V. Repleátur os méum láude.</l><l xml:id="m-e84e2e84-3f0c-4052-87ad-b3092debaa79" facs="#m-fe258eb6-1639-4021-835f-fe25d2124d3b" label="lyrics-like">K. Ut cántem glóriam túam, tóta díe magnitúdinem túam.</l><l xml:id="m-aa7ad73b-9655-4af6-8adc-fc26325aa399" facs="#m-50cb337c-bec3-4539-9b2d-b9014bfecdb9" label="lyrics-like">V. Dómine avérte fáciem túam a peccátis méis.</l><l xml:id="m-91dddef9-74e1-4209-b742-0478c216d6da" facs="#m-69bb0fee-bcf7-459c-9292-0a64ab69bd8d" label="lyrics-like">R. Et ómnes iniquitátes méas déle.</l><l xml:id="m-5863299e-15d4-4dfc-96e4-8f7b22fa7ab8" facs="#m-df62105a-b363-478a-b4dd-8e87842f9239" label="lyrics-like">V. Cor múndum créa in me Déus.</l><l xml:id="m-5be84e8c-9e3e-4aec-974d-2fff2fc5e451" facs="#m-8bd758fd-63fd-4760-b088-4b31fd493e99" label="lyrics-like">R. Et spíritum réctum ínnova in viscéribus méis.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>